[statement]
A package providing one name twice, at a version at least once, conflicts
with itself, and apk never installs it: `p1` provides `x` and `x=1`, and
asked for `x=1`, apk refuses.

[repository]
P:p1
V:1
p:x x=1


[request]
x=1

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   p1-1:
|     conflicts: p1-1[x] p1-1[x=1]
|     breaks: world[x=1]
refused
